# {{ .Name }}: CSOC

Everything this CSOC runs, as ArgoCD deploys it. CSOC writes these files
through pull requests; merge one and ArgoCD applies it.

CSOC owns this directory and re-renders all of it for every change, so make
changes through CSOC: a hand edit here shows up as a diff in CSOC's next PR.

| Path | What |
| --- | --- |
| `root.yaml` | The root Application. It syncs `apps/`. |
| `apps/` | One Application per component: ArgoCD, External Secrets, the AWS Load Balancer Controller, CloudNativePG, the Keycloak operator, `csoc-config`, and the CSOC portal. |
| `values/` | Helm values for those Applications. |
| `manifests/` | Keycloak, its database, the realm, the default StorageClass, and the ExternalSecrets. |
| `keycloak-operator/` | The Keycloak operator, pinned to {{ .Versions.Keycloak }}. |

## Secrets

No secret is stored in this repo. They live in AWS Secrets Manager in
{{ .Region }}, under `gen3-csoc/{{ .Name }}/`, and External Secrets Operator
copies them into the cluster:

| Secrets Manager | Kubernetes Secret |
| --- | --- |
| `{{ secret . "github-app" }}` | `argocd/gitops-repo-creds` |
| `{{ secret . "keycloak-admin" }}` | `{{ .Namespace }}/keycloak-admin-credentials` |
| `{{ secret . "keycloak-client" }}` | `{{ .Namespace }}/csoc-keycloak-client` |
| `{{ secret . "nextauth" }}` | `{{ .Namespace }}/csoc-nextauth` |

